[{"id":"fm-core2-2.57-q1","number":1,"question":"<ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>On the same set of axes (you do not need to label the points of intersection) sketch <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=|x^2-3x|\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\frac52-\\frac12x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p>Hence solve <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"|x^2-3x|&gt;\\frac52-\\frac12x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> giving your answer in interval notation.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p>Sketch the curves <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=|x^2-3x|\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\frac52-\\frac12x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> on the same set of axes.</p>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.57/solutions/assets/diagrams/257/s1a_v01.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"x^2-3x=\\frac52-\\frac12x\\Rightarrow2x^2-5x-5=0\\Rightarrow x=\\frac54\\pm\\frac{\\sqrt{65}}4\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"x^2-3x=-\\frac52+\\frac12x\\Rightarrow2x^2-7x+5=0\\Rightarrow x=1\\text{ or }x=\\frac52\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore x\\in\\left(-\\infty,\\frac54-\\frac{\\sqrt{65}}4\\right)\\cup\\left(1,\\frac52\\right)\\cup\\left(\\frac54+\\frac{\\sqrt{65}}4,\\infty\\right).\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.57-q2","number":2,"question":"<p>Solve each of the following, giving your answer in set notation:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"|x^2-4|&gt;3\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"|x^2-2x-3|\\leq5\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"|x^2-x-6|&gt;2x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.57/solutions/assets/diagrams/257/s2a_v01.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"x^2-4=3\\Rightarrow x^2=7\\Rightarrow x=-\\sqrt7\\text{ or }x=\\sqrt7\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"x^2-4=-3\\Rightarrow x^2=1\\Rightarrow x=-1\\text{ or }x=1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\{x:x\\in\\mathbb R,\\ x&lt;-\\sqrt7\\}\\cup\\{x:x\\in\\mathbb R,\\ -1&lt;x&lt;1\\}\\cup\\{x:x\\in\\mathbb R,\\ x&gt;\\sqrt7\\}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.57/solutions/assets/diagrams/257/s2b_v01.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"x^2-2x-3=5\\Rightarrow x^2-2x-8=0\\Rightarrow x=-2\\text{ or }x=4.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\{x:x\\in\\mathbb R,\\ -2\\leq x\\leq4\\}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.57/solutions/assets/diagrams/257/s2c_v01.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"-(x^2-x-6)=2x\\Rightarrow x^2+x-6=0\\Rightarrow x=-3\\text{ or }x=2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"x^2-x-6=2x\\Rightarrow x^2-3x-6=0\\Rightarrow x=\\frac32\\pm\\frac{\\sqrt{33}}2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\{x:x\\in\\mathbb R,\\ x&lt;2\\}\\cup\\left\\{x:x\\in\\mathbb R,\\ x&gt;\\frac32+\\frac{\\sqrt{33}}2\\right\\}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.57-q3","number":3,"question":"<p>The following graph shows the curves <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=|ax^2+bx+c|\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"c\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are non-zero integers.</p><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.57/questions/assets/diagrams/257/q3_v01.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Find the possible values of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"c\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p>Using your answers for part (a), determine the values for which <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"|ax^2+bx+c|&lt;x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> giving your answer in set notation.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"k(x+3)(x-2),\\quad k=-2.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\pm2(x+3)(x-2)=\\pm(2x^2+2x-12).\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore a=2,\\ b=2,\\ c=-12\\quad\\text{or}\\quad a=-2,\\ b=-2,\\ c=12.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"2x^2+2x-12=x\\Rightarrow2x^2+x-12=0\\Rightarrow x=-\\frac14\\pm\\frac{\\sqrt{97}}4\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"2x^2+2x-12=-x\\Rightarrow2x^2+3x-12=0\\Rightarrow x=-\\frac34\\pm\\frac{\\sqrt{105}}4\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore x=-\\frac14+\\frac{\\sqrt{97}}4\\quad\\text{and}\\quad x=-\\frac34+\\frac{\\sqrt{105}}4\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\left\\{x:x\\in\\mathbb R,\\ -\\frac34+\\frac{\\sqrt{105}}4&lt;x&lt;-\\frac14+\\frac{\\sqrt{97}}4\\right\\}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.57-q4","number":4,"question":"<ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>On the same set of axes (you do not need to label the points of intersection) sketch <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=|x^3+x^2-4x-4|\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=10x+20\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p>Hence solve <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"|x^3+x^2-4x-4|&gt;10x+20\" data-display=\"false\"></span> giving your answer in interval notation.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p>Sketch the curves <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=|x^3+x^2-4x-4|\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=10x+20\" data-display=\"false\"></span> on the same set of axes.</p>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.57/solutions/assets/diagrams/257/s4a_v01.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"x^3+x^2-4x-4=10x+20\\Rightarrow x^3+x^2-14x-24=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow(x-4)(x+2)(x+3)=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"x=-3\\text{ or }x=-2\\text{ or }x=4\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=-2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> or <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore x\\in(-\\infty,-2)\\cup(4,\\infty).\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.57-q5","number":5,"question":"<p>Solve each of the following, giving your answer in set notation:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"|x^3-x|&gt;3x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"|x^3-2x|&gt;x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"|x^3-4x|\\leq3\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"x^3-x=3x\\Rightarrow x^3-4x=0\\Rightarrow x(x-2)(x+2)=0\\Rightarrow x=-2,\\ x=0\\text{ or }x=2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"x^3-x=-3x\\Rightarrow x^3+2x=1\\Rightarrow x(x^2+2)=0\\Rightarrow x=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.57/solutions/assets/diagrams/257/s5a_v01.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\{x:x\\in\\mathbb R,\\ x&lt;0\\}\\cup\\{x:x\\in\\mathbb R,\\ x&gt;2\\}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"x^3-2x=x\\Rightarrow x^3-3x=0\\Rightarrow x(x^2-3)=0\\Rightarrow x=0\\text{ or }x=\\pm\\sqrt3\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"x^3-2x=-x\\Rightarrow x^3-x=0\\Rightarrow x(x^2-1)=0\\Rightarrow x=0\\text{ or }x=\\pm1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.57/solutions/assets/diagrams/257/s5b_v01.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\{x:x\\in\\mathbb R,\\ x&lt;0\\}\\cup\\{x:x\\in\\mathbb R,\\ 0&lt;x&lt;1\\}\\cup\\{x:x\\in\\mathbb R,\\ x&gt;\\sqrt3\\}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"x^3-4x=x(x^2-4)=x(x-2)(x+2)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"x^3-4x=3\\Rightarrow x^3-4x-3=0\\Rightarrow(x+1)(x^2-x-3)=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"x=-1\\text{ or }x=\\frac12\\pm\\frac{\\sqrt{13}}2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"x^3-4x=-3\\Rightarrow x^3-4x+3=0\\Rightarrow(x-1)(x^2+x-3)=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"x=1\\text{ or }x=-\\frac12\\pm\\frac{\\sqrt{13}}2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.57/solutions/assets/diagrams/257/s5c_v01.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\left\\{x:x\\in\\mathbb R,\\ -\\frac12-\\frac{\\sqrt{13}}2\\leq x\\leq\\frac12-\\frac{\\sqrt{13}}2\\right\\}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\cup\\{x:x\\in\\mathbb R,\\ -1\\leq x\\leq1\\}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\cup\\left\\{x:x\\in\\mathbb R,\\ -\\frac12+\\frac{\\sqrt{13}}2\\leq x\\leq\\frac12+\\frac{\\sqrt{13}}2\\right\\}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.57-q6","number":6,"question":"<ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>On the same set of axes (you do not need to label the points of intersection) sketch <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\left|\\frac{2x+1}{x-1}\\right|\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=x+3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p>Hence solve <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\left|\\frac{2x+1}{x-1}\\right|&gt;x+3\" data-display=\"false\"></span> giving your answer in set notation.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p>Consider <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\dfrac{2x+1}{x-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>; when <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=-\\frac12\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Asymptotes: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Sketch <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\left|\\dfrac{2x+1}{x-1}\\right|\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=x+3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.57/solutions/assets/diagrams/257/s6a_v01.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{2x+1}{x-1}=x+3\\Rightarrow2x+1=(x+3)(x-1)\\Rightarrow x^2-4=0\\Rightarrow x=-2\\text{ or }x=2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{2x+1}{x-1}=-(x+3)\\Rightarrow2x+1=-(x+3)(x-1)\\Rightarrow x^2+4x-2=0\\Rightarrow x=-2\\pm\\sqrt6\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=-2+\\sqrt6\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\{x:x\\in\\mathbb R,\\ x&lt;-2\\}\\cup\\{x:x\\in\\mathbb R,\\ -2+\\sqrt6&lt;x&lt;1\\}\\cup\\{x:x\\in\\mathbb R,\\ 1&lt;x&lt;2\\}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.57-q7","number":7,"question":"<p>Solve each of the following, giving your answer in set notation:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\left|\\frac{3x-2}{x+1}\\right|&gt;2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\left|\\frac{2x-1}{x-2}\\right|&lt;3x+2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\left|\\frac{x^2-4}{x-1}\\right|\\leq4\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p>Consider <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\dfrac{3x-2}{x+1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=-2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>; when <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=\\frac23\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Asymptotes: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Sketch <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\left|\\dfrac{3x-2}{x+1}\\right|\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.57/solutions/assets/diagrams/257/s7a_v01.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{3x-2}{x+1}=2\\Rightarrow3x-2=2(x+1)\\Rightarrow x=4\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\{x:x\\in\\mathbb R,\\ x&lt;-1\\}\\cup\\{x:x\\in\\mathbb R,\\ -1&lt;x&lt;0\\}\\cup\\{x:x\\in\\mathbb R,\\ x&gt;4\\}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p>Consider <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\dfrac{2x-1}{x-2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\frac12\" data-display=\"false\"></span>; when <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=\\frac12\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Asymptotes: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Sketch <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\left|\\dfrac{2x-1}{x-2}\\right|\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=3x+2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.57/solutions/assets/diagrams/257/s7b_v01.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{2x-1}{x-2}=3x+2\\Rightarrow2x-1=(3x+2)(x-2)\\Rightarrow3x^2-6x-3=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow x=1+\\sqrt2\\text{ or }x=1-\\sqrt2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{2x-1}{x-2}=-(3x+2)\\Rightarrow2x-1=-(3x+2)(x-2)\\Rightarrow3x^2-2x-5=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow x=-1\\text{ or }x=\\frac53,\\quad\\text{so }x=\\frac53\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\{x:x\\in\\mathbb R,\\ 1-\\sqrt2&lt;x&lt;\\frac53\\}\\cup\\{x:x\\in\\mathbb R,\\ x&gt;1+\\sqrt2\\}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p>Consider <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\dfrac{x^2-4}{x-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>; when <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=\\pm2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Asymptote: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Sketch <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\left|\\dfrac{x^2-4}{x-1}\\right|\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.57/solutions/assets/diagrams/257/s7c_v01.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{x^2-4}{x-1}=4\\Rightarrow x^2-4=4(x-1)\\Rightarrow x^2-4x=0\\Rightarrow x=0\\text{ or }x=4\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{x^2-4}{x-1}=-4\\Rightarrow x^2-4=-4(x-1)\\Rightarrow x^2+4x-8=0\\Rightarrow x=-2\\pm2\\sqrt3\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\{x:x\\in\\mathbb R,\\ -2-2\\sqrt3\\leq x\\leq0\\}\\cup\\{x:x\\in\\mathbb R,\\ -2+2\\sqrt3\\leq x\\leq4\\}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.57-q8","number":8,"question":"<p>Solve each of the following, giving your answer in interval notation:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"1-|\\cosh x|&lt;0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"|1-\\sinh x|\\leq1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"|\\sinh x|+\\cosh x\\geq2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.57/solutions/assets/diagrams/257/s8a_v01.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"x\\in(-\\infty,0)\\cup(0,\\infty).\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.57/solutions/assets/diagrams/257/s8b_v01.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"1-\\sinh x=1\\Rightarrow\\sinh x=0\\Rightarrow x=\\ln(0+\\sqrt{0^2+1})=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"1-\\sinh x=-1\\Rightarrow\\sinh x=2\\Rightarrow x=\\ln(2+\\sqrt{2^2+1})=\\ln(2+\\sqrt5)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"x\\in[-1,\\ln(2+\\sqrt5)].\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.57/solutions/assets/diagrams/257/s8c_v01.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sinh x+\\cosh x=2\\Rightarrow\\frac12(e^x-e^{-x})+\\frac12(e^x+e^{-x})=2\\Rightarrow e^x=2\\Rightarrow x=\\ln2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"-\\sinh x+\\cosh x=2\\Rightarrow-\\frac12(e^x-e^{-x})+\\frac12(e^x+e^{-x})=2\\Rightarrow e^{-x}=2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Then by symmetry, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=-\\ln2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore x\\in(-\\infty,-\\ln2]\\cup[\\ln2,\\infty).\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.57-q9","number":9,"question":"<p>Given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)=|-1+\\ln x|\" data-display=\"false\"></span> for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x&gt;0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, find the values for which <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)\\leq2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Give your answer in set notation.</p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"|-1+\\ln x|\\leq2.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"-1+\\ln x=2\\Rightarrow\\ln x=3\\Rightarrow x=e^3\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"-1+\\ln x=-2\\Rightarrow\\ln x=-1\\Rightarrow x=e^{-1}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\{x:x\\in\\mathbb R,\\ e^{-1}\\leq x\\leq e^3\\}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.57-q10","number":10,"question":"<p>Given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)=\\left|\\frac1{|x|}\\right|\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, find the values for which <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)\\geq1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Give your answer in set notation.</p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\left|\\frac1x\\right|\\geq1.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac1x=1\\Rightarrow x=1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac1x=-1\\Rightarrow x=-1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\{x:x\\in\\mathbb R,\\ -1\\leq x&lt;0\\}\\cup\\{x:x\\in\\mathbb R,\\ 0&lt;x\\leq1\\}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.57-q11","number":11,"question":"<p>Given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)=\\left|\\cos x-\\frac12\\right|\" data-display=\"false\"></span> for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"-\\pi&lt;x\\leq\\pi\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, find the values for which <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)\\geq\\frac12\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Give your answer in interval notation.</p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\left|\\cos x-\\frac12\\right|\\geq\\frac12.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\cos x-\\frac12=\\frac12\\Rightarrow\\cos x=1\\Rightarrow x=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\cos x-\\frac12=-\\frac12\\Rightarrow\\cos x=0\\Rightarrow x=-\\frac\\pi2\\text{ or }x=\\frac\\pi2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"x\\in\\left(-\\pi,-\\frac\\pi2\\right]\\cup[0]\\cup\\left[\\frac\\pi2,\\pi\\right].\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.57-q12","number":12,"question":"<p>Given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)=\\left|\\frac{ax-1}{x-b}\\right|\" data-display=\"false\"></span> for positive constants <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"1&lt;a&lt;4\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b&gt;1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, find the values for which <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)\\geq4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Give your answer in set notation in terms of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<p>Consider <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\dfrac{ax-1}{x-b}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\frac1b\" data-display=\"false\"></span>; when <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=\\frac1a\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Asymptotes: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=b\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=a\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Sketch <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\left|\\dfrac{ax-1}{x-b}\\right|\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.57/solutions/assets/diagrams/257/s12_v01.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{ax-1}{x-b}=4\\Rightarrow ax-1=4(x-b)\\Rightarrow ax-1=4x-4b\\Rightarrow ax-4x=1-4b\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow x=\\frac{1-4b}{a-4}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{ax-1}{x-b}=-4\\Rightarrow ax-1=-4(x-b)\\Rightarrow ax-1=4b-4x\\Rightarrow ax+4x=1+4b\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow x=\\frac{1+4b}{a+4}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\left\\{x:x\\in\\mathbb R,\\ \\frac{1+4b}{a+4}\\leq x&lt;b\\right\\}\\cup\\left\\{x:x\\in\\mathbb R,\\ b&lt;x\\leq\\frac{1-4b}{a-4}\\right\\}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]}]